# NPC archers at a runner (docs/manual-aim.md, stage 4): the hero runs sideways to and fro 12 m in front of a
# bandit and a paladin who shoot where they stand (`archer`): by hand with the lead, without it, by the dice
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02   # Onar's field: open and level for 25 m round the facing (open)
turn 210
wait 500
clear 3000
immortal player on
still player on
zones player
cam follow 700 250 150

